1
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:34,680
Have you ever thought about

2
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:37,760
why Guo Zijian, of all people, was assigned to

3
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:39,600
the Red 1st Battalion of our 396th Brigade

4
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:40,760
as the battalion commander?

5
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:42,320
I don't even need to think about it.

6
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:43,520
Know what?

7
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:45,560
He made a mistake and was sent here for punishment.

8
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,760
You're just speaking out of anger.

9
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:49,400
Our Red 1st Battalion

10
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,720
is the flagship of the group army.

11
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:54,160
Sent to an honors battalion for punishment?

12
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,680
Then you tell me why.

13
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,360
Let me tell you the truth.

14
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,280
It was Deputy Corps Commander Liang's idea.

15
00:01:59,880 --> 00:02:01,240
Deputy Corps Commander Liang?

16
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,400
Guo Zijian,

17
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:08,400
although he acts a little out of line,

18
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:11,200
some of his ideas regarding army reform,

19
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:13,000
and even his intentions,

20
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:15,640
suit Deputy Corps Commander Liang's taste.

21
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:19,280
I think Xu Lingjun is watching him too.

22
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,960
I think it won't be long before

23
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:23,680
he's transferred to Group Army Training.

24
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:25,560
I get it now.

25
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:30,440
This kid is just here to pad his resume!

26
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,040
Pad his resume?

27
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:35,880
Given his performance these past 3 months,

28
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:38,080
alienating everyone around him,

29
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:40,080
do you think he's padding his resume?

30
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:41,720
Not to mention,

31
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,800
after he arrived at the 1st Battalion,

32
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,120
how much it has changed

33
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:47,920
is obvious to everyone.

34
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,520
Why didn't you tell me this earlier?

35
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,080
Tell you what?

36
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,200
About Deputy Corps Commander Liang.

37
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:56,480
Deputy Corps Commander Liang ordered us

38
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:57,960
not to give him any special treatment.

39
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:59,440
He just wanted to see

40
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,920
exactly how capable he is.

41
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,400
The reason I'm telling you now

42
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,320
is that I hope you can

43
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:08,040
look at the big picture

44
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:09,600
and be more objective

45
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,400
when dealing with Guo Zijian.

46
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:12,600
Objective,

47
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:13,920
or polite?

48
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,160
Objective, of course.

49
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,480
The thing is,

50
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:18,880
he might suit the commander's taste,

51
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,520
but he doesn't suit mine.

52
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,640
Old Suo, I'll say it again.

53
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,680
You must keep that quick temper of yours

54
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,680
under control.

55
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,400
Let me tell you,

56
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:27,000
I shudder every time I think about it.

57
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,400
I always worry something will go wrong.

58
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,280
Don't forget,

59
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:33,280
you are at a critical stage right now.

60
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:39,240
Why do I feel like

61
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:42,800
this isn't the commander testing him?

62
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:45,600
This is him testing me!

63
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,840
I've noticed

64
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:52,160
that our great Political Commissar Kang's

65
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,720
ideological work

66
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,760
has gone up a notch.

67
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,960
I was just confused.

68
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:12,600
Guo Zijian

69
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,240
Staff Officer Liang

70
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:18,760
Battalion Commander Guo

71
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:19,399
Yes?

72
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:21,880
Is there something else?

73
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,440
I just wanted to thank you.

74
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:24,480
Thank me for what?

75
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,360
For supporting the First Battalion.

76
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,760
I wasn't supporting the First Battalion.

77
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:30,920
I was just sticking to the facts.

78
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:32,280
Alright.

79
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:34,160
Then thank you for your fairness.

80
00:04:34,280 --> 00:04:36,040
You're welcome. It's my duty.

81
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:39,440
Could I get your contact info?

82
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,200
Let's keep in touch.

83
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:01,640
Goodbye.

84
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:12,600
What's going on?

85
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,800
What do you mean, what's going on?

86
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,480
That Staff Officer Liang...

87
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:20,000
...is a rare talent.

88
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,800
Let's keep in touch.

89
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:39,560
Speak.

90
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,480
Why so serious?

91
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,760
I'm your sister, not one of your soldiers.

92
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:46,920
If you have nothing else, I'm hanging up.

93
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,280
Wait, I do! I have something.

94
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:49,400
Bro.

95
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:52,440
You haven't taken your annual leave yet?

96
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:55,320
My graduation ceremony is in half a month.

97
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,640
Can you come back for it?

98
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,400
Mom and Dad will be there.

99
00:05:58,520 --> 00:05:59,960
Do I really need to go?

100
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:02,240
How can they compare to you?

101
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,480
No one can take

102
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:05,200
my brother's place in my heart.

103
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:06,920
Bro.

104
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:10,040
It's the most important moment of my life.

105
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:12,240
I'll be heartbroken if you don't come.

106
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:14,400
How about this?

107
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:15,760
I'll tell Chen Hanxiao not to come,

108
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:16,680
and make room for you.

109
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:17,800
All right, all right.

110
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,160
Don't give me that.

111
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,360
So are you coming or not?

112
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,880
I have an assignment coming up.

113
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:24,040
We'll see when the time comes. Gotta go.

114
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:29,080
What?

115
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:31,160
Girlfriend?

116
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,680
What girlfriend?

117
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,680
Mind your own business.

118
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,360
Since you have a girlfriend,

119
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:39,520
when dealing with other female comrades,

120
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,440
you must keep your distance.

121
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:43,560
We are a disciplined force.

122
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:45,520
You must be loyal in your relationships.

123
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,480
You're overthinking this.

124
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,920
I just made one phone call,

125
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,400
and you've already figured out

126
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:52,920
which kindergarten my kids will go to?

127
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:53,760
Of course.

128
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:55,640
Our military kindergarten

129
00:06:55,760 --> 00:06:56,680
is really quite good.

130
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:57,440
Your sister-in-law is currently...

131
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,960
Okay, okay, okay. That's enough.

132
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:13,760
One, two, three, four!

133
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:14,920
Five kilometers!

134
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:16,280
Oh, how I love you!

135
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:17,760
Skip a single day,

136
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,040
And I miss you to death!

137
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,400
Brothers over there!

138
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:20,960
Push harder!

139
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,720
Did you hear?

140
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,040
Our commander is getting transferred.

141
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:25,840
What?

142
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:27,080
Stop talking nonsense.

143
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,520
That's impossible.

144
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,840
Why is it impossible?

145
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:33,000
He came here as the acting commander.

146
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:34,400
Do you know what "acting" means?

147
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:35,440
It means it's temporary.

148
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:37,600
No, where did you hear this nonsense?

149
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:39,800
Don't worry about where I heard it.

150
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:41,000
Everyone's talking about it anyway.

151
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:43,040
He was chosen by Group Army Training.

152
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:45,200
He's just using us as a stepping stone.

153
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,040
No way.

154
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:47,920
The Group Army's tactical exercise...

155
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,000
...is about to begin.

156
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:51,200
He just got us the main assault role.

157
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:52,840
He wouldn't abandon us now.

158
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:55,120
Stop spreading these rumors.

159
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:59,080
Why are you getting mad at me?

160
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:00,640
I'm upset about it too.

161
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,000
Well, I don't believe it.

162
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:06,320
Our commander definitely wouldn't do that.

163
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:07,960
Yeah, Squad Leader.

164
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,640
I don't think he'd do that either.

165
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,800
But what he wants is one thing.

166
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,760
If the Group Army insists on moving him,

167
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:14,520
what can he do?

168
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:17,080
Keep quiet. Nobody will think you're mute.

169
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:17,680
Look.

170
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,360
No way.

171
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:21,440
I'm going to find Lao Sun and Lao Gao now.

172
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:23,040
We'll petition our superiors together.

173
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:24,760
We have to keep our commander here.

174
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,320
Company Commander!

175
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:48,000
Why aren't you guys organizing training?

176
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:48,520
Where are you headed?

177
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,360
Commander, you can't leave.

178
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,880
Right, you can't leave.

179
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,800
Who said I'm leaving?

180
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,960
See, I told you it was just a rumor.

181
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,600
It's your fault, you and your big mouth.

182
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:05,920
As for our commander, the group army...

183
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,240
...does have a new appointment in mind.

184
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:09,040
But exactly what kind of appointment...

185
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:10,440
...hasn't been officially issued yet.

186
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:12,280
So until then...

187
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:14,040
...stop making wild guesses.

188
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,280
Especially...

189
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:17,680
...don't pull stunts like this petition.

190
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:18,520
Do you hear me?

191
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:19,160
But...

192
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,880
...we still have to voice our opinions.

193
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:23,280
If the transfer order comes down...

194
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:24,640
...won't it be too late?

195
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,520
Li Songwei.

196
00:09:26,280 --> 00:09:28,640
You used to want me gone more than anyone.

197
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:30,880
What, now you can't bear to see me leave?

198
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:34,560
I can't bear it. So what?

199
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:36,040
It's not just me...

200
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:37,960
...everyone hates to see you go, right?

201
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:38,800
Right, exactly! Commander!

202
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:40,360
Commander, we don't want you to leave.

203
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:43,800
Before the higher-ups assign my new job...

204
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,600
...they'll definitely ask for my opinion.

205
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,640
Since everyone wants me to stay...

206
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:51,920
...even if I have to throw a tantrum...

207
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,640
...I'll firmly refuse to leave.

208
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:55,720
You said it yourself.

209
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,480
Don't you fool us.

210
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,200
All right.

211
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,680
Stop being so mushy.

212
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:04,800
The group army's combat drill starts soon.

213
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:07,120
Our First Battalion is the main assault.

214
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:08,760
Put more of your focus...

215
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,280
...into training.

216
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:13,520
We must prove to everyone in this exercise

217
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:16,640
...that we're still the Red Army Battalion.

218
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:18,040
Yes, sir!

219
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,200
Head back, all of you.

220
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,480
And prepare well for training.

221
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:33,840
What did Deputy Commander Liang tell you?

222
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:35,360
Just one thing.

223
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:36,920
Await instructions.

224
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,440
How's the repair going?

225
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,560
It's done.

226
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:54,680
Good. Go get some rest.

227
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:55,560
Yes, Commander.

228
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:08,280
Commander,

229
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:13,160
What is it?

230
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:15,200
I...

231
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:18,600
Didn't Li Songwei pass on the message?

232
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:20,120
Are you here to persuade me too?

233
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,200
No, Commander.

234
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:23,600
I wanted to say,

235
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:27,120
don't take Commander Li's words to heart.

236
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:28,960
If

237
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,960
you really want to go to Operations,

238
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:34,560
then you should go.

239
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:41,240
Come on up.

240
00:11:48,880 --> 00:11:49,440
Have a seat.

241
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:56,400
Commander,

242
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,360
honestly, Operations and Training

243
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:00,280
is a really good place.

244
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:02,280
After all, it's a headquarters unit,

245
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:04,840
not as grueling as our grassroots units.

246
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:08,200
Besides,

247
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,880
there's more room for promotion.

248
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:11,800
For you personally,

249
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:13,840
it really is a better choice.

250
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:16,800
Commander,

251
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:20,480
you've done enough for our 1st Battalion.

252
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:21,600
Really.

253
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,320
You've made the 1st Battalion

254
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:25,000
change so much.

255
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:27,040
But we

256
00:12:27,280 --> 00:12:29,400
can't act like unweaned children,

257
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,640
relying on you for everything.

258
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:33,320
And we certainly can't

259
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:34,800
hold you back.

260
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:38,360
With you saying that,

261
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,720
I didn't come to the 1st Battalion

262
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:42,040
and serve as its commander in vain.

263
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:46,080
By the way, Commander.

264
00:12:50,520 --> 00:12:51,680
I want to give you this.

265
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:57,240
A Type 99A.

266
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:04,760
This must have taken a lot of work.

267
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:06,600
You're just giving it to me?

268
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:07,440
Willing to part with it?

269
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:08,640
I am.

270
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:10,000
Commander,

271
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:10,880
last time,

272
00:13:10,880 --> 00:13:12,400
that book you gave me about exoskeletons,

273
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:13,360
I read it too.

274
00:13:13,800 --> 00:13:14,680
If I get the chance,

275
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:16,280
I'd like to try it out.

276
00:13:17,040 --> 00:13:18,360
I'll start with a model first.

277
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:21,240
Once I've learned everything I need,

278
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:22,760
I'll make a real suit for you.

279
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:24,600
Wow.

280
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:26,680
Making that thing isn't easy.

281
00:13:27,040 --> 00:13:28,360
Besides needing the knowledge,

282
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:30,000
you also need funding.

283
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:31,320
Commander,

284
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:32,880
do you know

285
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,880
the most important thing I've learned

286
00:13:34,880 --> 00:13:35,720
from you?

287
00:13:36,640 --> 00:13:38,200
It wouldn't be arrogance, would it?

288
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,480
Of course not, Commander.

289
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:41,520
Really,

290
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,720
what I learned from you is that

291
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:45,440
as long as you dare to dream and act,

292
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:46,560
your goals

293
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:48,200
can be achieved.

294
00:13:48,920 --> 00:13:50,000
Hesitating and overthinking

295
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:52,080
will only keep you standing still.

296
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:56,000
Good job, Wu Dongsheng.

297
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:57,640
Capable in both theory and practice,

298
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,520
you truly are our top soldier.

299
00:14:01,880 --> 00:14:02,960
Thank you for the gift.

300
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,520
I'll take good care of it.

301
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:21,880
Guo Zijian.

302
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:28,160
What?

303
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:30,800
Are you here to learn from me,

304
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:32,680
or to fulfill our bet?

305
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:35,760
I'm not interested in your crooked tricks.

306
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:37,240
I need to talk to you.

307
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:38,480
I heard

308
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:40,560
you're moving to Group Army Training.

309
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:42,960
If that's the case,

310
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:44,960
why do you insist on going against me?

311
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:47,760
Even if your battalion leads the attack,

312
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,480
changing commanders right before battle...

313
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,880
don't you think it will affect the drill?

314
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:52,600
Jiang Shengqiang.

315
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:55,760
Whatever the organization plans for me,

316
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:57,560
while I'm still with the 1st Battalion,

317
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:59,200
I will lead it well.

318
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,320
Also,

319
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:02,840
the First Battalion's current success

320
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:04,680
is not just thanks to me, Guo Zijian.

321
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:06,560
Even if I leave right this second,

322
00:15:06,560 --> 00:15:07,640
I believe the First Battalion

323
00:15:07,760 --> 00:15:10,120
can still do well in the drill.

324
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:13,640
And let me correct you on one thing.

325
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:16,520
I never wanted to

326
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:17,440
go against you.

327
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:19,280
You didn't get the main attack role

328
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:21,680
because you lack the capability.

329
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:28,040
Guo Zijian!

330
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:38,200
Comrades,

331
00:15:39,280 --> 00:15:41,800
we just received combat orders from above.

332
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:44,440
The troops will move out immediately.

333
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:45,920
For so many years,

334
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:48,040
our Red First Battalion,

335
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:50,320
despite being an honors battalion

336
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:52,440
and a traditional Red Army unit,

337
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:53,880
has, however,

338
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:55,400
for a long time

339
00:15:55,400 --> 00:15:56,320
failed to be

340
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:58,800
a solid benchmark military battalion.

341
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:00,480
But this time,

342
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:02,800
we are different.

343
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:05,280
We will carry this glory,

344
00:16:05,280 --> 00:16:06,440
this honor,

345
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:08,720
and this readiness for combat

346
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:10,400
as we head to the frontlines of the drill.

347
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,080
Before we set off,

348
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:15,200
I have an urgent announcement to make.

349
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:17,400
After repeated deliberation

350
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:19,280
by the higher command,

351
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:21,360
as of today,

352
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:24,320
Comrade Guo Zijian's appointment is here.

353
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:27,040
Comrade Guo Zijian

354
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:31,040
is officially our Battalion Commander.

355
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:32,880
Now,

356
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:35,000
let's welcome Commander Guo

357
00:16:35,160 --> 00:16:36,520
to address everyone

358
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:38,640
and say a few words.

359
00:16:44,800 --> 00:16:45,640
Location

360
00:16:46,040 --> 00:16:47,160
Training Ground

361
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:48,440
Objective

362
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:49,520
Victory

363
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,960
Battalion, attention!

364
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:53,880
fix bayonets!

365
00:16:54,040 --> 00:16:55,480
Move out!

366
00:16:55,520 --> 00:16:56,880
Yes, sir!

367
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:02,160
Currently,

368
00:17:02,160 --> 00:17:03,920
a portion of the Blue Army's forces

369
00:17:03,920 --> 00:17:05,640
is advancing toward Yuhuang Peak.

370
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:09,160
Yuhuang Peak

371
00:17:09,359 --> 00:17:11,119
has always been the high ground

372
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:12,400
fiercely contested in past exercises.

373
00:17:12,520 --> 00:17:13,680
Whoever takes Yuhuang Peak

374
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:15,960
will secure the most advantageous

375
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,880
offensive position in this battle.

376
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:21,280
The Blue Army wants to strike first,

377
00:17:21,760 --> 00:17:22,960
but this tactic

378
00:17:23,119 --> 00:17:24,839
seems to lack a bit of originality.

379
00:17:25,760 --> 00:17:26,480
Exactly.

380
00:17:26,800 --> 00:17:27,839
Reconnaissance shows

381
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:29,320
that the troops sent to Yuhuang Peak

382
00:17:29,320 --> 00:17:30,800
are not their main force.

383
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:32,240
The Blue Army's command post

384
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:33,520
and its main force

385
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:35,120
should be in Xifeng Valley.

386
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:35,840
Therefore,

387
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,880
this is their decoy strategy.

388
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:39,280
Their objective

389
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:41,560
is to lure our troops to Yuhuang Peak,

390
00:17:41,560 --> 00:17:43,320
and then from Xifeng Valley,

391
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:44,520
target our command post

392
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:46,040
with a direct strike.

393
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,880
I will now announce the battle plan.

394
00:17:53,160 --> 00:17:54,400
Tomorrow morning at 0700 hours,

395
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:55,400
the first shot

396
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,240
will be fired by the 1st Battalion.

397
00:17:57,440 --> 00:17:58,000
Guo Zijian!

398
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:58,600
Sir!

399
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:00,080
Your mission is very clear.

400
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:01,960
Target the Blue Army's command post

401
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:02,960
and hit them hard!

402
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:03,360
Yes, sir!

403
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:04,200
2nd Battalion!

404
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:04,680
Sir!

405
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:06,040
You'll support the 1st Battalion.

406
00:18:06,040 --> 00:18:06,520
Yes, sir!

407
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:07,240
3rd Battalion!

408
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:07,640
Sir!

409
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:09,280
After the fire strike on the Blue Army,

410
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:10,280
encircle them

411
00:18:10,280 --> 00:18:12,560
and wipe out their effective forces.

412
00:18:12,560 --> 00:18:13,200
Yes, sir!

413
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:13,720
4th Battalion!

414
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:14,200
Sir!

415
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:15,200
Keep a close watch

416
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:17,320
on the Blue Army's Yuhuang Peak garrison.

417
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:20,120
Stop them coordinating with Xifeng Valley

418
00:18:20,120 --> 00:18:21,320
and returning to reinforce it.

419
00:18:21,360 --> 00:18:21,920
Yes, sir!

420
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:23,280
Everyone,

421
00:18:24,040 --> 00:18:25,000
this is our

422
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:26,960
last assembly before the battle.

423
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:28,160
I expect that,

424
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:30,680
assuming there are no major changes,

425
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:32,680
once I issue the combat order,

426
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:33,640
you will all,

427
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:34,480
without fail,

428
00:18:34,560 --> 00:18:35,680
resolutely execute it.

429
00:18:36,520 --> 00:18:37,360
Comrades,

430
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:39,320
though the 404th Brigade is tough,

431
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:42,080
I believe victory goes to a united force.

432
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:43,800
As long as our 396th Brigade

433
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:45,560
unites as one and fights bravely,

434
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:47,880
we will definitely create a miracle.

435
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:49,880
We will accomplish the mission!

436
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:51,000
Hurry up and get ready.

437
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:53,640
Battalion Commander Guo,

438
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:55,880
this

439
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:58,120
was provided by the Group Army's Recon Battalion

440
00:18:58,120 --> 00:18:59,880
as the main assault's strike target.

441
00:19:05,280 --> 00:19:06,360
Thank you, Chief of Staff.

442
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:32,520
Commander,

443
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:34,920
judging by the deployment here,

444
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:36,040
the Group Army's

445
00:19:36,040 --> 00:19:38,320
recon intel given to our recon battalion

446
00:19:38,520 --> 00:19:39,720
is accurate.

447
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:41,760
This is their command post.

448
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:43,720
Hold on.

449
00:19:44,040 --> 00:19:44,960
Keep watching.

450
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:49,800
Commander!

451
00:19:50,320 --> 00:19:52,640
The Blue Force recon unit is approaching!

452
00:19:57,240 --> 00:19:57,920
Fall back!

453
00:20:27,760 --> 00:20:28,520
Move.

454
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:29,760
Check up ahead.

455
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:36,640
Keep up.

456
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:45,880
I thought we were spotted.

457
00:20:46,280 --> 00:20:48,600
Luckily, it was just a recon squad leader.

458
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:50,800
He's no ordinary squad leader.

459
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:52,720
You know him?

460
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:54,640
He was one of my recruits.

461
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:57,160
From when you were a recruit squad leader?

462
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:58,560
Company Commander Li,

463
00:20:58,760 --> 00:21:01,000
don't underestimate him.

464
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:03,600
He's an all-army competition champion.

465
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:05,560
He's no rookie.

466
00:21:05,760 --> 00:21:06,600
Even so, he's just...

467
00:21:06,600 --> 00:21:08,120
all brawn and no brains.

468
00:21:08,120 --> 00:21:08,760
Shut up.

469
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:10,320
Continue.

470
00:21:11,040 --> 00:21:12,840
That guy is Yang Maolin.

471
00:21:13,120 --> 00:21:15,040
The recon squad leader from just now.

472
00:21:15,400 --> 00:21:17,080
I trained him, I know him.

473
00:21:17,320 --> 00:21:19,360
An elite scout like him

474
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:21,960
wouldn't miss a single clue.

475
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:24,200
He clearly saw it,

476
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:26,000
but chose to ignore it.

477
00:21:26,600 --> 00:21:28,400
It was too deliberate.

478
00:21:30,840 --> 00:21:31,440
Exactly.

479
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:34,280
This command post

480
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:36,160
is most likely a decoy.

481
00:21:56,360 --> 00:21:56,960
Commander.

482
00:21:57,560 --> 00:21:58,480
You're here so early.

483
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:02,840
You should've rested before coming.

484
00:22:03,320 --> 00:22:05,040
It's better to be fully rested

485
00:22:05,320 --> 00:22:06,200
to observe the enemy lines

486
00:22:06,280 --> 00:22:07,360
and direct the battle.

487
00:22:07,760 --> 00:22:09,240
I've got plenty of energy.

488
00:22:11,240 --> 00:22:12,600
This Long Yuanshan,

489
00:22:12,680 --> 00:22:14,760
truly is an expert of the Blue Force.

490
00:22:15,080 --> 00:22:16,880
Judging from his pre-exercise deployment,

491
00:22:17,240 --> 00:22:19,120
there are traps within traps.

492
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:20,320
Very impressive.

493
00:22:21,040 --> 00:22:23,240
Haven't you said this before?

494
00:22:23,360 --> 00:22:24,320
Throughout history,

495
00:22:24,680 --> 00:22:26,240
the most brilliant tactic in war

496
00:22:26,480 --> 00:22:27,880
is also the most common.

497
00:22:28,040 --> 00:22:29,800
That is, in the back-and-forth,

498
00:22:29,800 --> 00:22:31,240
mixing truth with deception.

499
00:22:31,520 --> 00:22:32,920
That's what makes a battle interesting.

500
00:22:33,040 --> 00:22:33,680
Right.

501
00:22:34,040 --> 00:22:35,200
If the battle isn't intense,

502
00:22:35,240 --> 00:22:36,440
the troops won't get solid training.

503
00:22:36,880 --> 00:22:37,480
And the officers

504
00:22:37,560 --> 00:22:39,240
won't be pushed to their limits.

505
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:40,440
You're absolutely right, Commander.

506
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:46,520
Give me a prediction.

507
00:22:46,880 --> 00:22:48,520
In this exercise,

508
00:22:49,160 --> 00:22:51,120
what are the Red Force's chances?

509
00:22:52,120 --> 00:22:52,560
Me?

510
00:22:52,760 --> 00:22:53,520
In my opinion...

511
00:22:55,360 --> 00:22:56,680
I'll give it to you straight, then.

512
00:22:56,680 --> 00:22:57,840
Were you going to lie to me?

513
00:22:57,840 --> 00:22:58,960
Of course you'll give it straight.

514
00:22:59,160 --> 00:22:59,720
Yes, sir.

515
00:23:02,520 --> 00:23:03,440
I feel that

516
00:23:03,440 --> 00:23:04,880
the higher-ups

517
00:23:05,320 --> 00:23:06,880
arranging for Comrade Suo Jian'an

518
00:23:06,880 --> 00:23:08,560
to assume command as acting head

519
00:23:09,080 --> 00:23:10,800
surely had their own reasoning.

520
00:23:12,120 --> 00:23:12,880
But I think

521
00:23:14,840 --> 00:23:16,680
regarding Comrade Suo Jian'an's boldness,

522
00:23:17,120 --> 00:23:17,800
he's a bit

523
00:23:17,960 --> 00:23:18,960
overly steady

524
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:19,800
and lacking in drive.

525
00:23:20,800 --> 00:23:21,440
Moreover,

526
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:22,960
his chief of staff is newly appointed.

527
00:23:23,240 --> 00:23:25,040
They'll have shortcomings in command.

528
00:23:25,680 --> 00:23:26,560
Therefore,

529
00:23:27,640 --> 00:23:28,680
my assessment is

530
00:23:29,200 --> 00:23:30,320
the Red Force is in danger.

531
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:34,680
Isn't Guo Zijian your favorite officer?

532
00:23:34,840 --> 00:23:36,320
Don't even mention him.

533
00:23:36,680 --> 00:23:37,360
Commander,

534
00:23:37,800 --> 00:23:39,920
I lost an operations officer for nothing.

535
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,600
Look at you getting all worked up.

536
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:42,880
What's there to be worked up about?

537
00:23:43,600 --> 00:23:45,080
Don't you think Guo Zijian

538
00:23:45,080 --> 00:23:47,280
is more suited to be a grassroots commander?

539
00:23:49,840 --> 00:23:52,040
Though he wasn't assigned to Operations,

540
00:23:52,080 --> 00:23:52,880
still,

541
00:23:52,960 --> 00:23:54,440
for discovering his potential,

542
00:23:54,720 --> 00:23:56,120
you deserve a lot of credit.

543
00:23:56,120 --> 00:23:57,560
I wouldn't dare claim that credit.

544
00:23:57,800 --> 00:23:58,960
Commander, without your nod,

545
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:00,680
with Guo Zijian's stubborn temper,

546
00:24:00,680 --> 00:24:01,560
he would never have made it

547
00:24:01,560 --> 00:24:03,200
into the ranks of our 8th Group Army.

548
00:24:05,520 --> 00:24:07,200
You've got quite a strong sense of honor.

549
00:24:10,840 --> 00:24:11,440
Ling Jun,

550
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:13,920
this exercise...

551
00:24:15,440 --> 00:24:16,360
my prediction is

552
00:24:16,560 --> 00:24:17,440
it'll be worth watching.

553
00:24:28,080 --> 00:24:28,600
Squad leader,

554
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:32,520
just now, you saw with your own eyes

555
00:24:32,520 --> 00:24:33,920
how the Red team's reconnaissance squad

556
00:24:33,920 --> 00:24:34,640
left.

557
00:24:34,800 --> 00:24:35,720
Of course.

558
00:24:36,520 --> 00:24:37,600
The one leading the Red team

559
00:24:37,760 --> 00:24:39,080
is a veteran scout.

560
00:24:39,280 --> 00:24:40,040
Plus,

561
00:24:40,040 --> 00:24:41,080
they kept a trick up their sleeve.

562
00:24:41,520 --> 00:24:42,680
The members of their squad

563
00:24:43,160 --> 00:24:44,320
had been gone for quite a while

564
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,840
before their rear guard finally retreated.

565
00:24:46,360 --> 00:24:47,320
Good thing

566
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:48,640
I slacked off a bit

567
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:49,320
and didn't stand up.

568
00:24:49,880 --> 00:24:51,400
I almost became their prisoner.

569
00:24:54,760 --> 00:24:55,800
They're pros.

570
00:24:59,480 --> 00:25:00,280
Chief of Staff,

571
00:25:00,680 --> 00:25:01,320
take a look.

572
00:25:01,320 --> 00:25:02,400
Does our deployment here

573
00:25:02,720 --> 00:25:03,760
still have any weak spots?

574
00:25:04,840 --> 00:25:05,640
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

575
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:07,720
I took office right before this drill.

576
00:25:07,840 --> 00:25:08,920
I'll defer to your judgment.

577
00:25:10,920 --> 00:25:12,040
No need to be modest.

578
00:25:12,600 --> 00:25:13,680
I actually know

579
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:16,200
you adapted to the role very quickly.

580
00:25:17,040 --> 00:25:17,560
I just

581
00:25:17,560 --> 00:25:18,600
did a bit of homework.

582
00:25:18,600 --> 00:25:19,400
I still have a long way to go.

583
00:25:21,280 --> 00:25:22,360
Based on the troop

584
00:25:22,360 --> 00:25:23,880
and firepower deployment,

585
00:25:24,120 --> 00:25:25,400
I haven't found any weak spots.

586
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:27,400
But regarding the frontline situation,

587
00:25:27,760 --> 00:25:28,560
I still want

588
00:25:28,760 --> 00:25:29,640
to go check it out in person.

589
00:25:30,160 --> 00:25:30,640
All right.

590
00:25:30,920 --> 00:25:31,720
Make it quick.

591
00:25:31,720 --> 00:25:32,200
Yes, sir.

592
00:25:39,760 --> 00:25:40,320
Brigade Commander.

593
00:25:47,080 --> 00:25:48,440
Watch what you call me.

594
00:25:50,320 --> 00:25:51,520
But right now, you

595
00:25:51,760 --> 00:25:53,320
are the Red team's commander.

596
00:25:53,840 --> 00:25:54,600
Besides,

597
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:58,200
Brigade Commander Yang is now

598
00:25:58,360 --> 00:25:59,360
entirely focused on

599
00:25:59,360 --> 00:26:00,880
this new research project.

600
00:26:02,040 --> 00:26:02,920
From the looks of it,

601
00:26:03,080 --> 00:26:05,120
he'll probably be transferred soon.

602
00:26:05,560 --> 00:26:06,120
Furthermore,

603
00:26:06,440 --> 00:26:08,040
before he joined the research team,

604
00:26:08,040 --> 00:26:09,760
he personally recommended you

605
00:26:09,760 --> 00:26:11,040
to be the acting Brigade Commander.

606
00:26:11,280 --> 00:26:11,880
This shows

607
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:13,560
that he highly approves of you.

608
00:26:14,280 --> 00:26:15,160
Besides,

609
00:26:15,600 --> 00:26:16,800
the group army this time

610
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:17,840
arranged for you

611
00:26:17,840 --> 00:26:20,480
to be the Red commander for this drill.

612
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:21,880
What does that show?

613
00:26:23,040 --> 00:26:24,520
It shows that after Commander Yang leaves,

614
00:26:24,800 --> 00:26:26,040
you becoming the Brigade Commander

615
00:26:26,040 --> 00:26:27,920
is a sure thing!

616
00:26:28,080 --> 00:26:29,560
What do you mean "a sure thing"?

617
00:26:31,520 --> 00:26:33,360
While I am still the Deputy Commander,

618
00:26:33,840 --> 00:26:35,240
we cannot break the rules.

619
00:26:36,080 --> 00:26:36,800
Keep that in mind.

620
00:26:37,480 --> 00:26:38,320
Fine, fine, fine.

621
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:39,160
Whatever you say.

622
00:26:39,360 --> 00:26:41,040
It won't be long now, anyway.

623
00:26:41,600 --> 00:26:43,120
How are the battalions deploying?

624
00:26:44,040 --> 00:26:44,560
Right.

625
00:26:44,920 --> 00:26:46,640
I'm here to report this to you.

626
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:48,040
Just now, when the commissar and I

627
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:49,480
went to each battalion

628
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:51,560
to inspect the troop deployments,

629
00:26:51,560 --> 00:26:52,680
we found that Guo Zijian was missing.

630
00:26:55,640 --> 00:26:56,840
Guo Zijian is missing?

631
00:26:58,320 --> 00:26:59,520
The battle is about to start!

632
00:26:59,840 --> 00:27:00,840
He's a battalion commander,

633
00:27:00,840 --> 00:27:01,800
yet he abandons his post!

634
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:03,400
Where did he go?

635
00:27:04,200 --> 00:27:04,880
We don't know.

636
00:27:05,080 --> 00:27:05,880
But the sentry said

637
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:07,480
he took 1st Company Commander Li Songwei

638
00:27:07,760 --> 00:27:09,000
to inspect the troops.

639
00:27:09,360 --> 00:27:10,320
But as for where exactly they went,

640
00:27:10,320 --> 00:27:11,720
he couldn't give a clear answer.

641
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:13,280
He was clearly trying to fool us.

642
00:27:16,560 --> 00:27:17,720
Guo Zijian...

643
00:27:18,200 --> 00:27:19,520
Whenever you mention his name,

644
00:27:19,640 --> 00:27:21,200
my eyelid twitches non-stop.

645
00:27:22,160 --> 00:27:23,000
I originally thought

646
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:23,960
that before the exercise,

647
00:27:24,160 --> 00:27:25,560
we could send this troublemaker packing.

648
00:27:25,840 --> 00:27:26,760
But I didn't expect

649
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:28,400
Deputy Commander Liang to change his mind.

650
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:30,240
No matter what,

651
00:27:30,720 --> 00:27:31,800
after the exercise is over,

652
00:27:31,920 --> 00:27:32,600
I think

653
00:27:32,840 --> 00:27:34,000
we need to grill his ass.

654
00:27:34,240 --> 00:27:35,120
He's completely out of line.

655
00:27:36,560 --> 00:27:37,160
Where is the commissar?

656
00:27:38,280 --> 00:27:39,520
The commissar told me to come back first

657
00:27:39,680 --> 00:27:41,600
to discuss the battle deployment with you.

658
00:27:41,880 --> 00:27:42,760
He's still at the 1st Battalion.

659
00:27:59,600 --> 00:28:00,360
Sang Haitian,

660
00:28:01,120 --> 00:28:02,080
tell me the truth.

661
00:28:02,520 --> 00:28:03,920
Where exactly did Guo Zijian go?

662
00:28:04,320 --> 00:28:05,400
You're the instructor,

663
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:06,120
he's the battalion commander.

664
00:28:06,600 --> 00:28:07,960
There's nothing to hide.

665
00:28:09,560 --> 00:28:10,280
Commissar,

666
00:28:10,760 --> 00:28:12,280
you're hiding a knife behind that smile.

667
00:28:12,840 --> 00:28:14,440
Calm down first, okay?

668
00:28:15,640 --> 00:28:16,520
You are

669
00:28:17,360 --> 00:28:18,480
the brigade party secretary,

670
00:28:18,600 --> 00:28:20,000
and I'm the battalion party secretary.

671
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:20,760
In front of you,

672
00:28:20,760 --> 00:28:22,720
I'd never dare lie to you.

673
00:28:22,720 --> 00:28:23,360
Right?

674
00:28:23,360 --> 00:28:25,240
Then why isn't he at any of the positions?

675
00:28:28,440 --> 00:28:29,120
Speak.

676
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:31,800
Commissar,

677
00:28:32,560 --> 00:28:32,960
I think

678
00:28:32,960 --> 00:28:35,160
you also know Comrade Guo Zijian well.

679
00:28:35,360 --> 00:28:36,320
Actually, he's a simple guy.

680
00:28:36,320 --> 00:28:37,040
Just a bit single-minded.

681
00:28:37,040 --> 00:28:38,240
All he thinks about is fighting.

682
00:28:38,240 --> 00:28:39,440
And how to win battles.

683
00:28:39,680 --> 00:28:40,760
Honestly, our country and our people

684
00:28:40,760 --> 00:28:42,040
need soldiers like him.

685
00:28:42,360 --> 00:28:42,960
Our troops

686
00:28:42,960 --> 00:28:44,320
also need officers like him.

687
00:28:44,320 --> 00:28:45,400
I think he's pretty good.

688
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:47,120
Sang Haitian,

689
00:28:47,320 --> 00:28:48,560
can you come up with some new lines?

690
00:28:48,680 --> 00:28:49,400
I did.

691
00:28:49,400 --> 00:28:49,960
I told him,

692
00:28:49,960 --> 00:28:51,800
he must save his strength for the battle.

693
00:28:52,000 --> 00:28:52,680
But he just wouldn't listen.

694
00:28:52,680 --> 00:28:54,200
He insists on doing everything himself.

695
00:28:54,520 --> 00:28:55,160
I guess right now

696
00:28:55,160 --> 00:28:56,160
he's off checking the roads again.

697
00:28:56,160 --> 00:28:57,360
Checking the roads isn't something

698
00:28:57,360 --> 00:28:58,080
that can be done in a day.

699
00:28:58,080 --> 00:28:59,000
Sang Haitian,

700
00:28:59,240 --> 00:29:00,440
your acting has really improved.

701
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:01,880
I wouldn't dare act in front of you.

702
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:03,560
Speak. Come on, tell me.

703
00:29:03,560 --> 00:29:04,080
Continue.

704
00:29:04,160 --> 00:29:05,800
I assure you, he'll be here right away.

705
00:29:05,960 --> 00:29:06,600
Report!

706
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:07,880
Speak.

707
00:29:08,120 --> 00:29:08,760
Chief,

708
00:29:08,880 --> 00:29:09,840
we've contacted the battalion commander.

709
00:29:10,480 --> 00:29:11,240
Where is he?

710
00:29:12,200 --> 00:29:12,920
The commander...

711
00:29:12,960 --> 00:29:13,760
Spit it out!

712
00:29:13,760 --> 00:29:14,440
The commissar is here.

713
00:29:14,440 --> 00:29:15,320
What can't you say?

714
00:29:15,320 --> 00:29:16,200
Tell the truth.

715
00:29:22,560 --> 00:29:23,840
He said he'll be here right away.

716
00:29:29,720 --> 00:29:30,600
Right away?

717
00:29:30,880 --> 00:29:31,520
Right away.

718
00:29:32,040 --> 00:29:33,240
Good, Sang Haitian.

719
00:29:34,400 --> 00:29:35,040
Tell me,

720
00:29:35,560 --> 00:29:36,760
all night long,

721
00:29:37,320 --> 00:29:39,360
how many times have you said "right away"?

722
00:29:40,760 --> 00:29:41,440
My fingers

723
00:29:41,800 --> 00:29:42,280
and toes

724
00:29:42,280 --> 00:29:43,000
added up

725
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:44,200
aren't enough to count them!

726
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:46,760
Commissar,

727
00:29:46,760 --> 00:29:47,840
when I say "right away" this time,

728
00:29:47,840 --> 00:29:49,160
he really will be here right away.

729
00:29:53,920 --> 00:29:54,480
Fine.

730
00:29:55,480 --> 00:29:56,720
Then I'll believe you one more time.

731
00:30:00,560 --> 00:30:01,080
Commissar,

732
00:30:01,920 --> 00:30:02,840
a big battle is coming.

733
00:30:03,400 --> 00:30:04,920
You must save your strength.

734
00:30:05,520 --> 00:30:06,800
You've walked over ten thousand steps.

735
00:30:06,800 --> 00:30:07,600
Have a seat.

736
00:30:09,880 --> 00:30:10,560
You really won't sit?

737
00:30:18,280 --> 00:30:19,720
Our commander specifically told us

738
00:30:19,880 --> 00:30:21,600
to make sure you two eat and drink well.

739
00:30:21,600 --> 00:30:22,080
See

740
00:30:22,120 --> 00:30:23,080
if there's anything else you need.

741
00:30:23,920 --> 00:30:25,360
We only need to see your commander.

742
00:30:26,520 --> 00:30:27,120
Our battalion commander,

743
00:30:27,120 --> 00:30:28,320
I really don't know where he is.

744
00:30:29,320 --> 00:30:29,840
Xiao Fang.

745
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:30,440
Here.

746
00:30:33,440 --> 00:30:34,680
These two comrades from directing

747
00:30:34,680 --> 00:30:35,760
want to see our battalion commander.

748
00:30:35,880 --> 00:30:36,840
You talk to them.

749
00:30:37,560 --> 00:30:38,080
Well, you two,

750
00:30:38,080 --> 00:30:38,880
I'll get back to work.

751
00:30:39,120 --> 00:30:39,600
Enjoy your meal.

752
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:45,680
Our battalion commander isn't available.

753
00:30:46,320 --> 00:30:47,320
Then we'll see the political instructor.

754
00:30:47,320 --> 00:30:48,320
Or the battalion staff officer.

755
00:30:48,320 --> 00:30:49,240
We'll see whoever is available.

756
00:30:49,560 --> 00:30:50,280
Reporting, sir.

757
00:30:50,720 --> 00:30:51,280
They...

758
00:30:51,280 --> 00:30:51,920
are all unavailable.

759
00:30:52,280 --> 00:30:52,720
You...

760
00:30:52,960 --> 00:30:53,520
It's fine.

761
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:55,480
Well, since that's the case,

762
00:30:55,480 --> 00:30:56,840
we'll just start our work ourselves.

763
00:30:56,880 --> 00:30:57,320
Let's go.

764
00:30:57,760 --> 00:30:58,560
You can't do that.

765
00:30:58,880 --> 00:30:59,920
Without orders from above,

766
00:31:00,120 --> 00:31:01,080
you can't wander around.

767
00:31:02,360 --> 00:31:03,480
We aren't wandering around.

768
00:31:03,760 --> 00:31:05,120
We're from the directing group.

769
00:31:05,200 --> 00:31:06,680
We're authorized to inspect everywhere.

770
00:31:07,080 --> 00:31:08,040
Everywhere?

771
00:31:08,240 --> 00:31:09,600
Men and women have boundaries, you know.

772
00:31:09,600 --> 00:31:10,960
How can you say you'll inspect everywhere?

773
00:31:11,040 --> 00:31:12,480
What are you talking about?

774
00:31:12,840 --> 00:31:13,960
Anyway, it's just not allowed.

775
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:16,200
Squad Leader Hong.

776
00:31:16,360 --> 00:31:16,920
Here.

777
00:31:16,920 --> 00:31:17,600
Please take note.

778
00:31:17,600 --> 00:31:18,160
Yes, sir.

779
00:31:18,520 --> 00:31:19,400
Red Force, Battalion 1

780
00:31:19,400 --> 00:31:21,160
is obstructing the directing team's work,

781
00:31:21,320 --> 00:31:22,640
preventing us from obtaining

782
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:24,040
regular exercise information.

783
00:31:24,040 --> 00:31:25,200
Therefore, points will be deducted.

784
00:31:25,400 --> 00:31:25,760
Yes, sir.

785
00:31:26,600 --> 00:31:27,840
Don't write nonsense!

786
00:31:28,560 --> 00:31:30,160
Now, can we begin our work?

787
00:31:49,800 --> 00:31:51,080
Staff Officer Liang, Squad Leader Hong.

788
00:31:51,360 --> 00:31:52,320
Have you eaten?

789
00:31:53,120 --> 00:31:54,080
Battalion Commander Guo.

790
00:31:54,280 --> 00:31:55,760
Your First Battalion sure puts on airs.

791
00:31:55,840 --> 00:31:57,560
Not only did you block us from the chief,

792
00:31:57,560 --> 00:31:58,800
you also obstructed our normal work.

793
00:31:58,960 --> 00:32:00,040
Did that really happen?

794
00:32:02,400 --> 00:32:03,280
How could you treat

795
00:32:03,280 --> 00:32:05,080
two directing team comrades like this?

796
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:06,440
You're asking for it, kid.

797
00:32:06,440 --> 00:32:07,080
Aren't you?

798
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:08,760
Remember this from now on.

799
00:32:09,840 --> 00:32:11,440
To these two beautiful directing officers,

800
00:32:11,560 --> 00:32:12,320
you must be polite.

801
00:32:12,320 --> 00:32:13,120
And you must show respect.

802
00:32:13,520 --> 00:32:14,080
Understood?

803
00:32:14,120 --> 00:32:15,000
Yes, Battalion Commander!

804
00:32:16,160 --> 00:32:17,720
He's a recruit, he doesn't know better.

805
00:32:18,800 --> 00:32:19,800
That's no big deal.

806
00:32:20,280 --> 00:32:21,200
But Battalion Commander Guo,

807
00:32:21,680 --> 00:32:23,320
if you have any combat operations

808
00:32:23,320 --> 00:32:24,160
or deployments,

809
00:32:24,160 --> 00:32:25,480
you absolutely must not hide them from us.

810
00:32:25,840 --> 00:32:27,280
Otherwise, if the records are incomplete,

811
00:32:27,280 --> 00:32:28,520
and you lose points after the exercise,

812
00:32:28,520 --> 00:32:29,440
it will be hard to explain.

813
00:32:29,600 --> 00:32:30,840
What operations could there be?

814
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:33,000
I'm just going to check on the companies.

815
00:32:33,360 --> 00:32:34,520
You've been working so hard.

816
00:32:34,560 --> 00:32:35,920
Don't you want to rest a bit more?

817
00:32:36,080 --> 00:32:36,560
No need.

818
00:32:36,760 --> 00:32:37,840
We'll start working right now.

819
00:32:38,000 --> 00:32:38,920
So dedicated.

820
00:32:39,880 --> 00:32:40,320
Please.

821
00:32:45,200 --> 00:32:45,880
Thanks for your hard work.

822
00:32:49,240 --> 00:32:49,760
Battalion Commander.

823
00:32:50,080 --> 00:32:50,920
The Commissar is still waiting for you.

824
00:32:51,120 --> 00:32:51,680
Got it.

825
00:32:53,280 --> 00:32:54,120
Good job.

826
00:32:54,360 --> 00:32:55,440
I'll reward you later.

827
00:32:55,800 --> 00:32:56,800
You taught me well, Commander.

828
00:32:59,360 --> 00:33:00,600
Staff Officer Liang, Staff Officer Liang!

829
00:33:00,600 --> 00:33:02,440
You really surprised me today.

830
00:33:02,800 --> 00:33:03,480
How so?

831
00:33:04,520 --> 00:33:05,200
Give this to me.

832
00:33:07,320 --> 00:33:08,000
Squad Leader Hong.

833
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:08,600
Please record this.

834
00:33:08,600 --> 00:33:10,880
Red's 1st Battalion obstructed our work,

835
00:33:10,880 --> 00:33:12,600
preventing us from getting normal intel.

836
00:33:12,600 --> 00:33:13,600
Mark it as a point deduction.

837
00:33:13,920 --> 00:33:14,360
That was a good bluff.

838
00:33:14,360 --> 00:33:15,400
I almost actually recorded it.

839
00:33:18,040 --> 00:33:18,880
I wasn't bluffing.

840
00:33:21,880 --> 00:33:22,840
Wait, no.

841
00:33:22,840 --> 00:33:23,840
You really want to record it?

842
00:33:24,920 --> 00:33:26,440
I'm acting according to regulations.

843
00:33:26,440 --> 00:33:27,520
Is there a problem?

844
00:33:32,080 --> 00:33:33,120
N-No.

845
00:33:33,120 --> 00:33:34,080
I thought you...

846
00:33:34,360 --> 00:33:35,000
had loosened up.

847
00:33:40,600 --> 00:33:41,360
By the way, Staff Officer Liang.

848
00:33:41,480 --> 00:33:42,200
Go ahead.

849
00:33:42,360 --> 00:33:43,920
We were just doing our normal jobs.

850
00:33:44,120 --> 00:33:45,560
Why did they stop us?

851
00:33:45,880 --> 00:33:47,520
Could they really be up to something?

852
00:33:49,280 --> 00:33:51,120
You've finally grasped the main point.

853
00:33:51,120 --> 00:33:51,960
So what do we do?

854
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:53,640
Just one thing:

855
00:33:54,240 --> 00:33:55,160
Keep a close eye.

856
00:33:56,400 --> 00:33:58,840
Does that mean we're in for a good show?

857
00:33:59,040 --> 00:34:00,080
Staff Officer Liang.

858
00:34:00,560 --> 00:34:01,120
Tiejun.

859
00:34:02,040 --> 00:34:02,560
This time

860
00:34:02,560 --> 00:34:04,560
is our first showdown with Suo Jian'an.

861
00:34:05,360 --> 00:34:06,080
Did you know?

862
00:34:06,720 --> 00:34:07,920
This Suo Jian'an,

863
00:34:08,239 --> 00:34:09,000
before the military reform,

864
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:10,920
was the military region's theory model.

865
00:34:11,840 --> 00:34:13,040
But I just don't know

866
00:34:13,440 --> 00:34:14,679
how much real ability he has.

867
00:34:16,440 --> 00:34:17,320
I heard

868
00:34:17,440 --> 00:34:18,880
that 396th Brigade's Commander Yang

869
00:34:18,880 --> 00:34:20,280
is executing a special mission this time.

870
